WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.400
This is LocoLLM: a small AI model that runs on an ordinary laptop.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.000
Free, and private.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.600
Plug-in adapters make it an expert in one subject.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.700
Our brief: build the first real one, and prove that it works.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.600
We tested the base model on 15 business topics.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.100
It aced 11, but scored zero on Australian privacy law.

7
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.400
So that became our test.

8
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:30.000
Before any training, we sealed away 170 test questions.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.700
Then we trained on 615 examples, on a free GPU.

10
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.600
We changed one setting per run.

11
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.000
Putting the reasoning first helped.

12
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.500
Training the MLP layers lifted accuracy from 38 to 81 percent.

13
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.000
A small model, careful testing, and honest numbers.

14
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.300
Explore the results below.
